# Agent workflow

```text
Requirement → identify service (docs/ai/services.md)
  → read docs/ai feature + relevant reference
  → load matching .cursor/skills/*/SKILL.md
  → clone a similar existing implementation
  → follow .cursor/rules/*.mdc
  → implement → unit tests → build → review diff
```

- **Source of truth is the current code**, then `docs/ai/`. Older `.cursor/*.md` notes are historical; if they conflict (e.g. Kafka), follow the code.
- Do not invent services, schemas, brokers, or auth models.
- Do not write other services' databases. S2S via Refit in `Fgs.Contracts.Clients`.
- Never commit secrets, tokens, or connection strings.
- Prefer the **smallest change** that matches an existing neighbor in the same service.
